 "notes": "Hand-made expedition map. Big walkable regions: the Heart in the middle, four large regions around it (Frostkeep N, Stormreach E, Bloomwild S, Ember Quarry W), four calm corner islands and four outer landings. A ring road of wide bridges joins every region to its corners, so most of the map can be walked. Only six bridges and one wind road lead into the Heart: these are the chokepoints. Perches float over the four diagonal gaps; reach them by a one-way pad or an updraft chain and glide back down. Angles are degrees around an island's centre (0 = east, 90 = south); 'sheer' arcs can't be grabbed, every other rim has a stone lip. Generated by tools/make_skyreach.py.",
